33
00:02:04.717 --> 00:02:06.995
Learn to separate fact versus opinion.

34
00:02:07.583 --> 00:02:10.665
Your turn. Say: Fact vs. opinion.

35
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.977
Fact vs. opinion.

36
